OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after man dies in
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder after a late-night stabbing.
OL,9,FMembers of the public flagged down
OL,10,Femergency crews after finding a man
OL,11,Funconscious in High Street, Stonehouse,
OL,12,FGloucestershire, at 23:15 GMT on
OL,13,FSunday. Despite crews' best efforts,
OL,14,Fthe victim was pronounced dead at the
OL,15,Fscene.
OL,17,FAbout 15 minutes after that incident,
OL,18,Fpolice received a report of a man
OL,19,Ftrying to break into an address in Cam
OL,20,Fand assaulting two people,
OL,21,FGloucestershire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
